WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:03.650
Wealth, fame, power...

3
00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:04.440
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,

4
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.820
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates, obtained everything the world has to offer.

5
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.360
attained this and everything else
the world had to offer.

6
00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:10.820
And his dying words drove
countless souls to the seas.

7
00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:11.660
What he said in his final moments drove countless souls to the seas.

8
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.660
You want my treasure?

9
00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:13.700
You can have it!

10
00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.450
Go ahead.

11
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:17.040
I left everything I gathered
together in one place.

12
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:16.660
Find it!

13
00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.250
Everything is right where I left it!

14
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.250
Now you just have to find it!

15
00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.750
These words lured
men to the Grand Line

16
00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:26.380
People set their sights on the Grand Line in pursuit of their dreams.

17
00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.920
in pursuit of dreams greater than
they'd ever dared to imagine!

18
00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:29.630
The world has truly entered the Great Pirate Era!

19
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.850
This is the time known as
the Great Pirate Era!

20
00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:35.640
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

21
00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:41.440
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

22
00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:42.690
One Piece!

23
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:52.700
Compasses? Not for me. Left them all behind

24
00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:58.500
I'm headed out to sea, with my heart serving as guide

25
00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
Following the ancient map to the spot marked "X" reveals

26
00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:09.760
Yeah, it's only legendary till someone proves it's real

27
00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:13.710
When the world's got you down,

28
00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:16.850
lean on your crew, they'll turn it around

29
00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:22.190
Their biorhythm will carry you through

30
00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.230
We're gonna make the most of it

31
00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:31.400
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

32
00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:36.990
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

33
00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:40.040
Got some change to my name,

34
00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:43.250
and maybe you wanna be my friend?

35
00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:48.130
We are, we are on the cruise!

36
00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:49.760
WE ARE!

37
00:01:56.310 --> 00:01:58.470
Now which one of you is Arlong?

38
00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:01.240
Well, that just
happens to be my name.

39
00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:02.970
Good. You can call me Luffy.

40
00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:06.840
Luffy...? What are you supposed to be?

41
00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:08.590
A pirate!

42
00:02:08.590 --> 00:02:09.650
Hold it right there.

43
00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:13.690
Hahaha!
Where do you think you're going?

44
00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:15.030
You wanna talk to the boss?

45
00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:18.700
Well, you gotta talk
to us first. Get it?

46
00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.000
So let's talk...

47
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:21.790
That's far enough.

48
00:02:22.770 --> 00:02:24.290
Move it!

49
00:02:26.530 --> 00:02:29.340
So what does a pirate want with me?

50
00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:53.570
Who the hell are you?

51
00:02:58.210 --> 00:03:02.080
Luffy... Help me.

52
00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:05.210
That's for making our navigator cry!

53
00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:13.340
Back off!
You're outta your league!

54
00:03:15.930 --> 00:03:17.130
Geez...

55
00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:19.900
You just had to run
on ahead by yourself.

56
00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:22.470
Don't worry. I can handle
these bozos on my own.

57
00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:24.340
Oh, you fool...

58
00:03:24.340 --> 00:03:26.600
I never said anything
about being worried.

59
00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:29.690
I just don't want you
hoggin' all the action.

60
00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:31.020
Oh.

61
00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:35.960
Well, I just wanna let you guys know
that I don't mind if you hog it all.

62
00:03:35.960 --> 00:03:39.030
I see you're raring to go as usual.

63
00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:41.640
Ohhh! It's him...!

64
00:03:41.640 --> 00:03:44.330
That's the unknown swordsman
I was telling you about!

65
00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:45.830
Roronoa Zoro...

66
00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:46.910
I thought so...

67
00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.830
That bastard tricked me...

68
00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:49.830
I can't believe it.

69
00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:52.840
I fell for it. Hook, line, and sinker...

70
00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.800
Wait. Hook, line, and sinker...

71
00:03:56.010 --> 00:03:57.380
Hey, look!

72
00:03:57.480 --> 00:03:59.680
Whaaa?! But... He's dead...!

73
00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:01.750
We saw Nami kill him!

74
00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:04.520
Hmph! That Nami was
a traitor all along...

75
00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:08.190
Just as I suspected...

76
00:04:15.970 --> 00:04:18.150
Who are those guys?!

77
00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:20.910
Hold it!

78
00:04:22.050 --> 00:04:24.080
That guy just decked Arlong!

79
00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:25.870
Unbelievable!

80
00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:29.710
No human should be able to do that.

81
00:04:30.360 --> 00:04:31.670
Are they...

82
00:04:32.090 --> 00:04:33.420
Didn't we tell you...?

83
00:04:33.420 --> 00:04:35.380
Just stay back here.

84
00:04:35.490 --> 00:04:38.760
Now do you understand why we're
keeping you away from that fight...?

85
00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:40.630
You guys'll just get in their way.

86
00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:42.140
But why...

87
00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:43.810
That's what I don't understand.

88
00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:47.020
What reason could they
possibly have to fight?

89
00:04:47.310 --> 00:04:48.560
Reason?

90
00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:52.860
Big Sis Nami was crying.

91
00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:59.610
Do they need any more reason
than that to put their lives on the line?

92
00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:04.450
A pirate...?

93
00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:06.540
Of course.

94
00:05:06.550 --> 00:05:09.410
This is all
starting to make sense now...

95
00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:13.000
You've been after
Nami this whole time...

96
00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:14.170
But... Hahahaha!

97
00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:18.510
The girl is mine and
I'm not giving her up!

98
00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:20.330
Hahahaha!

99
00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:24.300
A bunch of idiots like
you aren't worth Arlong's time!

100
00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:26.760
We know how to deal with you.

101
00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:35.590
Not that!

102
00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:37.730
Oh, no... It's here!

103
00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:43.820
What is goin' on here, guys?!

104
00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:46.660
Momoo! Rise!

105
00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:55.050
It's a monster...!

106
00:05:55.050 --> 00:05:58.750
That's the beast from the Grand Line
that destroyed the town of Gosa!

107
00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:09.140
Huh?

108
00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:12.060
Aaaauugh!

109
00:06:12.170 --> 00:06:15.010
It's actually real...! Oh, no!

110
00:06:15.010 --> 00:06:16.520
It's Momoo.

111
00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:23.910
Well, look who's back.

112
00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:25.620
Seems he's a friend of the fishmen.

113
00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:32.770
Hey...! Stop...! Where are you going?!

114
00:06:32.770 --> 00:06:34.210
Get back here, Momoo!

115
00:06:34.340 --> 00:06:36.000
You can't just leave! Momoo!

116
00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:39.130
Leaving...? Now, now...?

117
00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:40.960
Isn't that a shame?

118
00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:50.470
But... I suppose if you really want
to run away, then who am I to stop you?

119
00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:54.520
Well then...?

120
00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:04.860
It's coming right for us!

121
00:07:08.180 --> 00:07:13.330
Aaaaahh!
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

122
00:07:15.020 --> 00:07:16.720
Ahhhhhh!

123
00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:21.000
You're all mine...! You dumb cow!

124
00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:30.770
Looks like he's got a plan... For once.

125
00:07:30.770 --> 00:07:34.100
We'll see. I've got a
bad feeling about this.

126
00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:53.740
His arms stretched!

127
00:07:55.350 --> 00:07:58.250
So he must have devil fruit powers.

128
00:07:58.390 --> 00:07:59.190
Powers?

129
00:07:59.190 --> 00:08:00.130
Aw, who cares?!

130
00:08:00.420 --> 00:08:02.960
Attack!

131
00:08:03.090 --> 00:08:04.170
Hey, let's get out of here!

132
00:08:04.220 --> 00:08:06.220
Whoa, wait...! What's he gonna do?!

133
00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:08.710
I'm not sure if I want to find out!

134
00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:11.470
Time for something new!

135
00:08:14.150 --> 00:08:18.690
Gum-Gum Pinwheel!

136
00:08:30.470 --> 00:08:31.620
Alright, that's it, Arlong!

137
00:08:31.640 --> 00:08:32.990
I'm done playing games with you!

138
00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:35.370
I didn't come here to
beat down all your cronies!

139
00:08:35.640 --> 00:08:37.750
I came here to teach you a lesson!

140
00:08:38.610 --> 00:08:40.080
So step up!

141
00:08:41.110 --> 00:08:42.960
Oh, I will, don't worry...

142
00:08:44.550 --> 00:08:48.720
Actually, I was just thinking about
how painfully I'll end your life.

143
00:08:49.020 --> 00:08:51.140
That was the worst plan ever!

144
00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:53.760
Yeah! Were you trying
to kill all of us too?!

145
00:08:59.030 --> 00:09:01.570
That boy's incredible.

146
00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:05.980
I just can't believe there's a human
who could throw that giant monster!

147
00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:08.820
It's as if the gods
themselves are fighting.

148
00:09:11.790 --> 00:09:14.370
How dare you hurt our brother!

149
00:09:15.430 --> 00:09:16.410
Very well...

150
00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:19.080
It seems that we must
now join in the fight.

151
00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:23.290
Now you'll get an education in the
inferiority of your species. Choo.

152
00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:26.250
Oh... really... I'd like to see that.

153
00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:32.760
Relax, sir... Let us handle this.

154
00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:35.930
If you go on one of your
rampages to squash these insects,

155
00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:39.480
you could destroy all
of Arlong Park. Choo.

156
00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:45.150
Please just let us
kill these weaklings!

157
00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:48.110
Alright... They're yours.

158
00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:54.820
Uh, guys... There's
something I should tell you.

159
00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:57.280
What the hell's that octopus doing?

160
00:09:57.500 --> 00:10:00.470
Octopus is best when
it's cut thin and salted...

161
00:10:00.470 --> 00:10:04.670
Add some olive oil and paprika and it makes
the perfect snack while drinking.

162
00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:07.130
So listen to me, guys,
I'm kind of in trouble...

163
00:10:07.510 --> 00:10:09.340
Take this! Zero Vision!

164
00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:12.130
Hachi Ink Jet!

165
00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:18.730
Idiot...! How come
you didn't dodge that?!

166
00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:22.770
Aaaaaah! I can't see squat!

167
00:10:23.270 --> 00:10:25.560
Now to finish you off!

168
00:10:28.240 --> 00:10:30.530
C'mon! Get outta there, Luffy! Run!

169
00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:33.490
Yeah, that's the problem...

170
00:10:33.680 --> 00:10:37.410
I can't run! I can't even walk!

171
00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:39.970
Huh?

172
00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:42.370
My feet are kinda stuck!

173
00:10:42.380 --> 00:10:45.450
But you're the one who stuck 'em
into the ground in the first place!

174
00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:47.920
Always thinking ahead.

175
00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:52.760
One Hachi Ink Jet served on the rocks!

176
00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:11.890
You're such a pain...

177
00:11:11.890 --> 00:11:15.120
Sanji, that was so
totally awesomely awesome!

178
00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:19.780
Looks like I ended up picking one
hell of an idiot to be my captain.

179
00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:20.490
We all did.

180
00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:23.380
Luffy's great...! Hey!

181
00:11:23.380 --> 00:11:26.650
But the truth... is that our
idiot captain is far better

182
00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:29.920
than a gang who'd prey on a lady.

183
00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:31.670
A lady, huh? Hmph!

184
00:11:32.270 --> 00:11:36.220
You rushed into certain
death for one lousy girl?

185
00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:38.180
"Lousy girl"...?

186
00:11:38.770 --> 00:11:40.340
If you insult Nami one more time,

187
00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:44.270
I can promise that you'll go
from fishman to fish sticks...

188
00:11:44.280 --> 00:11:45.230
Got that?

189
00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:48.850
Your skills are
quite exceptional for a human...

190
00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:52.980
But I must admit that chivalry from
a pirate seems just a little fake.

191
00:11:54.990 --> 00:11:58.240
I'm damn good at what I do,
and I guarantee you there's nothing fake

192
00:11:58.890 --> 00:12:01.990
about my desire to help
a beautiful lady in need.

193
00:12:04.830 --> 00:12:09.630
Looks like I'll be acquainting you with
the true superiority of the fishman species.

194
00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:15.380
Nice work... But they're still stuck.

195
00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:18.550
Still? They're still stuck?

196
00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:21.050
We could pull all day...

197
00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:23.810
And I bet my legs would
still be stuck in there.

198
00:12:24.030 --> 00:12:25.430
Hey, are you trying at all?!

199
00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:27.270
Or do you want to stay stuck here?!

200
00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:32.230
Maybe no one told you that the penalty
for playing around in Arlong Park...

201
00:12:32.470 --> 00:12:33.690
is death!

202
00:12:34.300 --> 00:12:35.730
C'mon!

203
00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:37.280
Get unstuck already! Get unstuck!

204
00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:39.240
Please, Luffy! Come on!

205
00:12:40.590 --> 00:12:41.620
Come here!

206
00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:42.990
Hey, Octopus!

207
00:12:43.290 --> 00:12:45.450
They're a little bit
busy at the moment.

208
00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:48.410
Why don't you take me on?

209
00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:52.500
Ohh! You're Zoro...! I forgot...!

210
00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:55.300
You can't get away with tricking me!

211
00:12:58.680 --> 00:13:03.510
And how dare you mercilessly
slaughter so many of my brothers!

212
00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:06.100
That stuff's old news, octopus man...

213
00:13:06.120 --> 00:13:09.120
I personally don't care what reasons
you have for wanting to kill me.

214
00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:10.940
The situation has changed...

215
00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:13.900
You see, the tables have turned...

216
00:13:14.090 --> 00:13:16.320
You're not the hunters
anymore, understand?

217
00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:18.540
Now it's you fish freaks
who're being hunted!

218
00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:19.860
Yeah, you tell him, Zoro...

219
00:13:21.060 --> 00:13:24.030
That octopus guy is yours... Nice.

220
00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:25.990
Luffy!

221
00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:27.330
Huh?

222
00:13:31.590 --> 00:13:36.630
Hey, I'm back.

223
00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:38.460
Oh, you're dead.

224
00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:40.420
Aw, crap.

225
00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:41.760
I get it now...

226
00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:44.430
You must actually want me to kill you.

227
00:13:48.530 --> 00:13:50.430
Hold on...

228
00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:53.230
Wasn't that the guy who
saved Genzo's life earlier?

229
00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:58.190
Hey, wait... You're the
people from Cocoyashi.

230
00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:00.280
Judging from the fact
that you all have weapons,

231
00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:04.200
I can only assume
that this is a rebellion.

232
00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:05.330
Then you'll all have to...

233
00:14:05.330 --> 00:14:07.160
Exploding Star!

234
00:14:08.010 --> 00:14:09.200
Big Bro Usopp!

235
00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:13.670
Did you think it would be easy?!

236
00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:15.580
You're dealing with me now!

237
00:14:17.550 --> 00:14:18.550
Enough!

238
00:14:18.550 --> 00:14:20.550
I'm going to get rid of you right now!

239
00:14:23.760 --> 00:14:25.800
Who is that lad?

240
00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:28.170
Brave one minute and cowardly the next.

241
00:14:28.170 --> 00:14:29.680
He's a baffling man.

242
00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:34.270
Get back here, "long nose"!

243
00:14:34.270 --> 00:14:36.610
Oh, you're one
to talk, "big mouth."

244
00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:40.190
Why are these people pirates?

245
00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:47.070
You morons are a
pathetic sight to behold.

246
00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:48.490
I'm sick of watching this.

247
00:14:48.510 --> 00:14:50.120
Now get out of my way.

248
00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:53.150
But sir, there's no
reason to go on a rampage.

249
00:14:53.150 --> 00:14:54.330
Think of Arlong Park.

250
00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:56.170
Don't worry, I won't.

251
00:14:56.190 --> 00:14:58.790
I just thought of
a fun game, that's all.

252
00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:02.760
Now you're going down!

253
00:15:05.720 --> 00:15:10.140
Do you honestly think your
sad little group can defeat us?

254
00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:12.100
So what if we do?

255
00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:14.350
Yeah, so what if we do, huh?

256
00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:15.560
Now let go!

257
00:15:15.960 --> 00:15:17.520
You got something to say to us?

258
00:15:24.600 --> 00:15:27.110
No way! No way! No way!

259
00:15:28.600 --> 00:15:31.830
Did you know that those with
devil fruit powers can't swim?

260
00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:36.330
But honestly, anybody in this situation
would sink right to the bottom.

261
00:15:36.340 --> 00:15:37.790
Hahahaha!

262
00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:40.130
The sea...?! No!

263
00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:43.880
Gum-Gum Pistol!

264
00:15:47.480 --> 00:15:49.260
Ouchie!

265
00:15:49.450 --> 00:15:51.260
You fool.

266
00:15:53.740 --> 00:15:55.680
How pointless.

267
00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:01.360
Luffy!

268
00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:03.110
Damn you!

269
00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:13.810
Ahahahahaha!

270
00:16:13.810 --> 00:16:15.650
Wait! Don't be stupid!

271
00:16:15.650 --> 00:16:18.670
Those fishmen can't wait for us
to jump in the water after him...

272
00:16:18.670 --> 00:16:23.000
They'd have an obvious advantage
in an underwater fight.

273
00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:27.120
There's only one way to save Luffy.

274
00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:30.680
We gotta take these guys out at
the same time, then go in the water.

275
00:16:31.860 --> 00:16:34.000
There's no time,
come on, let's do it.

276
00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:34.680
Yeah.

277
00:16:34.830 --> 00:16:37.180
So, how long can he hold out, huh...?

278
00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:38.640
Time is ticking.

279
00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:40.690
Oh, so that's the game.

280
00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:41.730
I get it.

281
00:16:44.610 --> 00:16:46.820
You can take the fish.

282
00:16:47.470 --> 00:16:49.660
You slice and trim the octopus.

283
00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:06.260
This is bad...
I'm almost outta breath!

284
00:17:07.270 --> 00:17:08.880
What now?! He can't help himself!

285
00:17:08.970 --> 00:17:10.090
What do we do?!

286
00:17:10.240 --> 00:17:11.840
Big Bro Luffy's gonna die!

287
00:17:20.450 --> 00:17:23.050
They can't even breathe underwater!

288
00:17:23.050 --> 00:17:25.770
Humans are such pitiful
creatures, aren't they?

289
00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:27.730
Hahahahaha!

290
00:17:27.950 --> 00:17:30.450
Hey...! Calamari...! Let's go!

291
00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:36.700
Game! Game!

292
00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:39.160
I'll kick your ass
in five seconds flat!

293
00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:41.600
We don't have more than three!

294
00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:43.380
Hey... What's the rush...?

295
00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:46.250
You're both running
headlong into death...

296
00:17:46.270 --> 00:17:48.880
None of you will
leave this place alive.

297
00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:04.770
Aw, crap! I'm gonna be killed!

298
00:18:06.420 --> 00:18:10.070
I'll beat his ass real quick and
then come save you, Luffy!

299
00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:11.780
Hachi Ink Jet!

300
00:18:19.380 --> 00:18:21.000
No, you bastard!

301
00:18:21.020 --> 00:18:22.290
My hair!

302
00:18:24.320 --> 00:18:26.130
But it's okay.

303
00:18:26.180 --> 00:18:27.200
It's only hair.

304
00:18:27.200 --> 00:18:28.420
It'll grow back.

305
00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:31.470
Now, Zoro, you can't beat me!

306
00:18:32.030 --> 00:18:36.550
I have six hands that will mesmerize
you with their wiggly beauty!

307
00:18:36.600 --> 00:18:37.510
Shut up!

308
00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:40.600
Hachi's Sword Catch!

309
00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:43.100
Now, you will see my skills!

310
00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:44.060
I'm gonna beat you!

311
00:18:46.180 --> 00:18:48.020
That hurt!

312
00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:49.900
I don't have time for this crap!

313
00:18:51.430 --> 00:18:53.360
Oh, not now!

314
00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:55.740
Is he still hurt?

315
00:18:55.750 --> 00:18:57.520
Lose focus and you lose your life!

316
00:18:57.520 --> 00:19:00.360
I bet you taste good with butter!

317
00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:02.620
I've got no time left!

318
00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:04.040
No time!

319
00:19:05.320 --> 00:19:07.040
Why don't you die?

320
00:19:10.220 --> 00:19:11.800
Too bad!

321
00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:14.550
Hachi's suckers are stuck!

322
00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:17.300
Don't just stick there!

323
00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:18.720
Get down here and fight!

324
00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:21.970
Damn coward!

325
00:19:22.670 --> 00:19:24.000
Stupid octopus!

326
00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:26.230
He's just trying to waste our time!

327
00:19:26.280 --> 00:19:28.300
But if we try to save Luffy now,

328
00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:30.720
they'll just drag us to the bottom
of the sea and we'll drown.

329
00:19:30.720 --> 00:19:33.900
If we sit here and do nothing,
then Luffy drowns for sure.

330
00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:35.860
We've got to think
of a way to help him.

331
00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:36.410
Yeah.

332
00:19:36.700 --> 00:19:37.360
Hold up.

333
00:19:38.020 --> 00:19:42.480
What good are the two of you gonna do
in the sea when you both can barely walk?

334
00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:45.780
If you're trying to figure out a
way to save that young man,

335
00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:49.580
then I believe I should be the
one to volunteer ahead of you.

336
00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:51.040
You'll save him?

337
00:19:51.900 --> 00:19:53.210
Genzo, I'm coming with you.

338
00:19:53.570 --> 00:19:54.380
Let's do it!

339
00:19:54.570 --> 00:19:55.220
I'm in!

340
00:19:55.240 --> 00:19:56.170
I'm going alone.

341
00:19:56.660 --> 00:20:00.960
The fishmen will suspect that we're up to
something if we go with such a large crowd.

342
00:20:00.960 --> 00:20:03.560
And I fear doing so may
cause more harm than good.

343
00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:04.640
But we could help them!

344
00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:05.930
Not another word about it.

345
00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:08.900
There's no point endangering
more people than we have to.

346
00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:10.230
I must go alone.

347
00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:12.020
Yes, sir!

348
00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:13.360
Thank you!

349
00:20:13.460 --> 00:20:14.940
We're counting on you.

350
00:20:15.330 --> 00:20:16.820
But please, hurry!

351
00:20:17.240 --> 00:20:18.030
Hold on!

352
00:20:19.180 --> 00:20:20.950
Genzo, I'm going too!

353
00:20:21.080 --> 00:20:21.910
Nojiko.

354
00:20:21.910 --> 00:20:23.080
You're hurt.

355
00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:27.060
You're not going to leave me out of this when
those guys are fighting for my sister's life!

356
00:20:27.060 --> 00:20:28.120
You can't!

357
00:20:29.400 --> 00:20:30.790
Fine.

358
00:20:30.810 --> 00:20:32.130
Come on, we have to hurry.

359
00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:32.790
Right!

360
00:20:34.740 --> 00:20:35.910
I'm sorry.

361
00:20:35.910 --> 00:20:39.120
If only I was stronger.

362
00:20:39.120 --> 00:20:40.550
Please save Luffy.

363
00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:42.140
Don't be too late.

364
00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:50.100
Hey, I have a question that I've
been meaning to ask you, Zoro.

365
00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:52.560
You're famous for your
three-sword technique.

366
00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:53.980
So why are you only using one?

367
00:20:54.180 --> 00:20:55.390
You're running scared with one.

368
00:20:55.390 --> 00:20:56.570
Why would I need three?

369
00:20:56.570 --> 00:20:57.440
Shut up!

370
00:20:57.500 --> 00:20:59.450
I've just been playing around with you.

371
00:20:59.470 --> 00:21:01.940
Actually, humans can't defeat me.

372
00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:04.410
I can tell you why, but I think
it'd be more fun to show you.

373
00:21:04.430 --> 00:21:05.450
Yeah, show.

374
00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:06.660
I like that.

375
00:21:06.660 --> 00:21:09.160
I think you're really going
to enjoy it a lot too.

376
00:21:10.510 --> 00:21:11.350
Dammit.

377
00:21:11.350 --> 00:21:13.290
I can't fight back the pain.

378
00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:21.760
Crap.

379
00:21:21.780 --> 00:21:22.800
I thought as much.

380
00:21:24.850 --> 00:21:27.250
You still haven't recovered
from your fight with Hawkeye.

381
00:21:27.250 --> 00:21:28.480
Zoro!

382
00:21:32.480 --> 00:21:35.400
Now you may tremble in fear
at Hachi's way of six blades!

383
00:21:36.990 --> 00:21:37.730
Hey!

384
00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:39.440
You're not supposed to die yet!

385
00:21:39.450 --> 00:21:41.030
I haven't even killed you!

386
00:21:43.310 --> 00:21:43.820
No!

387
00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:44.940
Zoro!

388
00:21:44.940 --> 00:21:45.620
I knew it!

389
00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:46.580
He's been faking it!

390
00:21:46.590 --> 00:21:47.240
So true.

391
00:21:48.610 --> 00:21:52.920
The way he's been pummeled would kill any
normal guy, but he tries to fight anyway.

392
00:21:52.970 --> 00:21:53.710
What'd you say?

393
00:21:56.110 --> 00:21:57.920
I thought it was strange.

394
00:21:57.920 --> 00:22:02.260
He walked around just like nothing had
happened after such a horrible fight.

395
00:22:02.570 --> 00:22:03.640
He's laid out flat.

396
00:22:10.680 --> 00:22:14.350
I told you to pay attention
to me, you weakling!

397
00:22:14.370 --> 00:22:16.470
I'm a 40th dan in Fishman Karate!

398
00:22:16.470 --> 00:22:17.530
Whoa.

399
00:22:17.530 --> 00:22:20.690
What the... what the
hell just happened?

400
00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:22.070
Sanji?

401
00:22:22.070 --> 00:22:23.820
It can't be him!

402
00:22:26.410 --> 00:22:27.240
Sanji!

403
00:22:30.010 --> 00:22:32.730
They're taken care of, Arlong.

404
00:22:32.730 --> 00:22:34.490
What would you like
us to do with Zoro?

405
00:22:34.490 --> 00:22:36.190
What a waste of time.

406
00:22:36.190 --> 00:22:38.030
Just toss him in the sea.

407
00:22:38.030 --> 00:22:39.750
Hardly entertaining.

408
00:22:42.090 --> 00:22:42.690
Aww.

409
00:22:42.690 --> 00:22:43.720
That's all?

410
00:22:43.730 --> 00:22:44.340
Well.

411
00:22:44.340 --> 00:22:47.220
They did manage to
make a bit of a mess.

412
00:22:47.220 --> 00:22:48.760
No big deal.

413
00:22:48.780 --> 00:22:51.180
As long as Arlong Park is still standing.

414
00:22:51.190 --> 00:22:52.480
True.

415
00:22:54.770 --> 00:22:56.310
No fair!

416
00:22:56.330 --> 00:22:57.400
He killed himself!

417
00:22:57.890 --> 00:23:01.030
I never got the chance to show him
how great of a swordsman I am!

418
00:23:01.260 --> 00:23:04.610
If he could have died on one of my six
blades, I could have stolen his fame!

419
00:23:05.040 --> 00:23:06.530
Well, it's no matter.

420
00:23:06.550 --> 00:23:09.690
There isn't a human alive that can
compare to my way of six blades!

421
00:23:09.690 --> 00:23:14.290
Behold the superior power that only a
six-armed master swordsman can attain!

422
00:23:22.610 --> 00:23:24.220
Enough, Hachi.

423
00:23:24.300 --> 00:23:26.340
I understand how you must feel.

424
00:23:26.360 --> 00:23:30.390
But if you continue this little
demonstration, you'll destroy Arlong Park!

425
00:23:32.070 --> 00:23:34.140
I'm sorry.

426
00:23:34.610 --> 00:23:37.610
I forgot I could destroy stuff.

427
00:23:37.610 --> 00:23:38.900
Don't get carried away.

428
00:23:39.030 --> 00:23:41.230
I'm fine now.

429
00:23:41.240 --> 00:23:43.440
Way of six blades.

430
00:23:43.450 --> 00:23:44.610
What a loser.

431
00:23:50.560 --> 00:23:52.290
Way to go!

432
00:23:54.110 --> 00:23:56.750
You're not dead!

433
00:23:56.820 --> 00:24:01.000
Let me make this clear for you,
you sorry excuse for a swordsman.

434
00:24:01.680 --> 00:24:03.550
There's a certain man I have to face.

435
00:24:04.540 --> 00:24:11.720
And until I see him, death
himself cannot touch me.

436
00:24:28.440 --> 00:24:29.920
He's still alive!

437
00:24:29.920 --> 00:24:32.410
Alright, Big Bro!

438
00:24:33.170 --> 00:24:35.830
That's the best punch
that fishman's got?

439
00:24:38.260 --> 00:24:41.250
The old man's kicks were a
hundred times worse than that.

440
00:24:41.820 --> 00:24:43.340
And I never even died.

